        "chapterId": 181,
        "headingId": 466,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>ALK</em>-rearranged renal cell carcinomas (RCCs) harbour gene fusions resulting from chromosome translocations involving the chromosome 2p23 breakpoint.</p>\r\n",
